; ============================================================
; List Operations Module
; Organized into semantic submodules:
; - list-core.ss: take, drop, replicate, iterate, unfold, etc.
; - list-search.ss: find, remove, count, index operations
; - list-transform.ss: map, zip, rotate, transpose, etc.
; - list-partition.ss: partition, group, chunk, split, dedupe
; ============================================================
